  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41159794",
      "title": "Adding Server-Side Input Validation",
      "lectureOrder": 124,
      "videoOrder": 116,
      "sourceHash": "afbfa6b0ea1822c645c2620fc9ae80fe5939ae953d913043f5807ae9f9ff0872",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 2.19,
          "en": "So, we're already providing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "better user feedback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 6.273,
          "en": "but that's not all we should do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.2,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "One other thing you should typically do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 13.5,
          "en": "when handling user data and form submissions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.5,
          "end": 17.523,
          "en": "is validate the values you are getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.72,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "And at the moment, we're not performing any validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 24.123,
          "en": "at all in our server action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "Now, we do have some validation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "because in that form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "I'm using those built-in special attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 37.08,
          "en": "Those required props here, to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.08,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "to make sure that we can't submit an empty form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 42.81,
          "en": "So if I press submit here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.81,
          "end": 46.86,
          "en": "I'm getting some errors automatically by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.86,
          "end": 50.67,
          "en": "And that's a useful behavior, but it's not enough,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.67,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "because I can disable that by going through the DevTools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 56.34,
          "en": "and removing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.34,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "Now of course, many users won't know about that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "but some do, and in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 66.45,
          "en": "those users could submit invalid values to my backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.45,
          "end": 68.43,
          "en": "because now I would not get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.43,
          "end": 69.873,
          "en": "for this field anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.52,
          "end": 75.363,
          "en": "And that's why client-side validation isn't enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.44,
          "end": 79.92,
          "en": "Instead, you should also validate on the server side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "And here you can now, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 85.68,
          "en": "set up some very complex validation rules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.68,
          "end": 90.18,
          "en": "You can use a third-party package that helps you with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.18,
          "end": 94.14,
          "en": "I'll keep it fairly simple to not waste your time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.14,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "but it's important to know that you should do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 98.43299999999999,
          "en": "in your applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 100.71000000000001,
          "en": "So, here we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.71000000000001,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "check if meal.title, once we trim it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 108.09,
          "en": "to remove excess whitespace on the left and right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.09,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "we could check if that's then equal to an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.57,
          "end": 114.213,
          "en": "which would mean that it's an invalid value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.47,
          "end": 119.733,
          "en": "We could also check if meal.title maybe even doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "So if it's false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 125.133,
          "en": "so if it wasn't part of the submitted data at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 129.24,
          "en": "And therefore here, we would now make it into this if block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.24,
          "end": 131.37,
          "en": "if we either don't have a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.37,
          "end": 133.503,
          "en": "or if we have one, but it's empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 137.34,
          "en": "And you should now probably do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.34,
          "end": 139.32,
          "en": "for all those fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.32,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "And then over here I'll actually add a helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "isInvalidText, could be a fitting name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 149.01,
          "en": "where I expect to get some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.01,
          "end": 153.6,
          "en": "and where I return the result of this check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "so that I return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "if the text we got is either false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 161.94299999999998,
          "en": "or it's an empty string after trimming it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.588,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "And now I can use isInvalidText down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 171.46,
          "en": "and check if meal.title is an invalid text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.68,
          "end": 177.68,
          "en": "or if meal.summary is an invalid text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 180.12,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.12,
          "end": 185.12,
          "en": "We can now relatively easily do that for all those fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.55,
          "end": 190.45,
          "en": "So, also do it for the instructions, for the creator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "and also for the creator email.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 199.56,
          "en": "And of course that should be meal.instructions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.56,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "meal.creator, and meal.creator_email.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "And we also might wanna check whether that maybe exists,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 210.99,
          "en": "but is an invalid email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.99,
          "end": 213.88,
          "en": "so, I'll also check if meal.creator_email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.57,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "does not include an @ symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 223.92000000000002,
          "en": "by adding an exclamation mark here at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.92000000000002,
          "end": 227.13,
          "en": "So, if the email does not include an @ symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 229.233,
          "en": "we also make it into this if block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 231.81,
          "en": "And last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.81,
          "end": 234.273,
          "en": "I want to check the image that we got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.11,
          "end": 238.413,
          "en": "I wanna check if maybe we don't have an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.46,
          "end": 243.63,
          "en": "So, if it's undefined, or if that image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.63,
          "end": 245.76,
          "en": "has a size that's equal to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.76,
          "end": 248.583,
          "en": "which means it's some kind of invalid file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 254.19,
          "en": "And in all those cases I wanna make it into this if block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.19,
          "end": 256.89,
          "en": "and then do what?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 256.89,
          "end": 260.1,
          "en": "Well, then we could throw an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 263.883,
          "en": "So, we could throw an error where we say invalid input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.47,
          "end": 268.38,
          "en": "And by doing that, if you save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 268.38,
          "end": 272.04,
          "en": "you ensure that if you reload here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 272.04,
          "end": 275.55,
          "en": "and you then enter values into all those fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.55,
          "end": 278.043,
          "en": "except the email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 279.75,
          "end": 284.46,
          "en": "and we then get rid of the required attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 284.46,
          "end": 285.99,
          "en": "on that email field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 285.99,
          "end": 287.52,
          "en": "so that we can submit it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 287.52,
          "end": 291.153,
          "en": "if we do all that, UCI gets this error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.95,
          "end": 296.43,
          "en": "Now, the error message here is a bit misleading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 296.43,
          "end": 300.48,
          "en": "because it's that main error page which we set up earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 300.48,
          "end": 303.69,
          "en": "We should probably set up a specific error page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 303.69,
          "end": 305.613,
          "en": "for sharing a meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 306.45,
          "end": 309.81,
          "en": "So, I will copy that here, paste it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 309.81,
          "end": 314.58,
          "en": "and say, \"Failed to create meal.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 315.753,
          "en": "That sounds better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 317.04,
          "end": 320.073,
          "en": "But the important thing is that we got some error at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.27,
          "end": 324.21,
          "en": "However, that's just one way of handling this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.21,
          "end": 326.97,
          "en": "Throwing an error as we do it here works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.97,
          "end": 329.7,
          "en": "but it also means that we destroy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.7,
          "end": 332.15999999999997,
          "en": "the entire input of the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.15999999999997,
          "end": 335.15999999999997,
          "en": "So, we throw away everything they entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 335.15999999999997,
          "end": 339.18,
          "en": "And that's not necessarily a great user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 339.18,
          "end": 341.97,
          "en": "It would be better if we would stay on this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 341.97,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "and just output some error message somewhere on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 350.49,
          "en": "above the form or below the form, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 350.49,
          "end": 352.953,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we'll implement next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
